    "category": "Water meter",
    "type_designations": ["SD-B", "SD-B1", "SD-BP", "SD-BP1"],
    "description": "Mechanical single-jet dry dial water meter type for metering of cold water, designed to measure, memorize and display the volume at metering conditions of water passing through the measurement transducer; intended for measurement of volumes of clean cold water in household or residential use. Essential parts: measuring mechanism consisting of the rotary vane wheel with an axle perpendicular to the flow direction, lower and upper tightening plates with bearing hubs; dry type mechanical register with 6 numbered drums and 2 continuously moving rotating pointers (register chamber casing of plastic or copper material); housing with inlet and outlet connections — brass body (SD-B, SD-B1) or plastic body (SD-BP, SD-BP1); adjustment device via external regulating; magnetic coupling for the connection of the measuring mechanism with the mechanical register. Non-essential parts: inlet strainer (optional), non-return valve (optional). Integrated equipment: pulse output (optional). Installed in horizontal position with the indication device positioned at the top, and in vertical position."
